/*
remoteUser
----------

Specifies the Linux user that the JetBrains IDE backend and its helper tools
(terminals, tasks, debuggers, etc.) run as inside the container.

• **Does not** affect the default user for the entire container—use `containerUser`
  for that.
• If omitted, it inherits the container’s main user (typically `root`).
• By default, the value comes from the base image used by the dev-container
  configuration unless you override it here.
*/
{
  "name": "1_5-spec_remoteUser",
  "build": {
    "dockerfile": "./Dockerfile"
  },
  "remoteUser": "developer"
}
